fetched. No playback/audio claims.\\\\n- Next: pin engine/Hub, inspect contracts, implement deterministic campaign and presentation.\\\\n')\nprint(slug)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Advanced-Dungeons-and-Danger-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-Treasure-of-Tarmin-1983-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-040257\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
