\\\"text('readiness',(e.kind==='minotaur'?'Seals broken '+((e.phase||1)-1)+'/3 · total damage '+(e.damageTaken||0)+'/'+e.maxWar+' · ':'')+(ready.length?\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> docs/ISSUES.md <<'EOF'\n8. Gate interaction was hidden from the second adventurer after the first used it: major co-op UI defect; eligibility now checks each adventurer's usedBy entry and explains personal transfer.\n9. Combat revive existed in rules but had no reachable UI action: major co-op UI defect; contextual Revive and pack action added for nearby fallen allies.\nEOF\nnode --check src/ui/interface.js\nnpm run build\"","aggregated_output":"npm notice run advanced-dungeons-and-danger@1.0.0 build\nnpm notice run node tools/build.mjs\nBuilt Advanced-Dungeons-and-Danger-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-Treasure-of-Tarmin-1983-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-040257.html (4.74 MiB; all runtime dependencies embedded)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_59","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('src/ui/interface.js');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"e.type\"'!=='\"'enemy'&&dist(p,e)<=1\\\", \\\"e.type\"'!=='\"'enemy'&&\"'!(e.type==='\"'chest'&&e.open)&&dist(p,e)<=1\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"+e.ring+'.\\\\\\\\nEmpty either strength to defeat it.'\\\", \\\"+e.ring+'.\\\\\\\\n'+(e.kind==='minotaur'?'Cumulative seal damage '+e.damageTaken+' / '+e.maxWar+'. Damage through either channel breaks the three seals; damage already earned remains.':'Empty either strength to defeat it.')\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"[['Continue in the vault',()=>{this.app.finishedDismissed=true;this.hide();}],['New expedition'\\\", \\\"[...(\"'!this.online?[['\"'Continue in the vault',()=>this.app.continueAfterVictory()]]:[]),['New expedition'\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"kicker:'Spawn into an open pack slot'\\\", \\\"kicker:'Spawn a stable object at your feet'\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('src/main.js');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"  retry(){if(this.net.mode\"'!=='\"'solo')return;\\\", \\\"  continueAfterVictory(){if(this.net.mode\"'!=='\"'solo')return;const r=this.net.model?.continueExpedition();if(r?.ok){this.finishedDismissed=true;this.state=this.net.model.state;this.net.state=this.state;this._lastPhase='explore';this.ui.hide();this.saveCheckpoint();}}\\\\n  retry(){if(this.net.mode\"'!=='\"'solo')return;\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> docs/ISSUES.md <<'EOF'\n10. An opened coffer intercepted contextual interactions before its loot, making coffer contents unreachable through F: major UI defect; opened coffers are excluded from contextual targets.\n11. Boss inspection described ordinary empty-pool defeat instead of cumulative seal progress: noncritical rules communication defect; boss-specific explanation and progress added.\n12. Victory Continue hid the ending but commands stayed locked: major completion-flow defect; explicit production continuation preserves the claimed treasure and permits exploration.\nEOF\nnode --check src/ui/interface.js\nnode --check src/main.js\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
