{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('tools/browser-test.py');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace(\\\"page.evaluate('__app.ui.hide();__app.ui.show(\\\\\\\"controls\\\\\\\")')\\\", \\\"page.evaluate('()=>{__app.ui.hide();__app.ui.show(\\\\\\\"controls\\\\\\\")}')\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"a.evaluate('__app.ui.pause();__app.ui.settings()')\\\", \\\"a.evaluate('()=>{__app.ui.pause();__app.ui.settings()}')\\\")\nold=\\\"\\\"\\\"        page.evaluate('''()=>{const c=document.getElementById('screen');const ev=(type,id,x,y)=>c.dispatchEvent(new PointerEvent(type,{pointerId:id,pointerType:'touch',isPrimary:id===11,clientX:x,clientY:y,bubbles:true,cancelable:true}));ev('pointerdown',11,80,400);ev('pointerdown',12,300,400);ev('pointermove',11,80,350);ev('pointermove',12,340,400);ev('pointerup',11,80,350);ev('pointerup',12,340,400)}''')\\\"\\\"\\\"\nnew=\\\"\\\"\\\"        cdp=context.new_cdp_session(page)\n        width=page.evaluate('innerWidth')\n        lx,rx=int(width*.22),int(width*.72)\n        def touch_event(kind,points):\n            cdp.send('Input.dispatchTouchEvent',{'type':kind,'touchPoints':[{'x':x,'y':y,'id':i,'radiusX':4,'radiusY':4} for i,x,y in points]})\n        touch_event('touchStart',[(11,lx,400)])\n        touch_event('touchStart',[(11,lx,400),(12,rx,400)])\n        touch_event('touchMove',[(11,lx,350),(12,rx+30,400)])\n        touch_event('touchEnd',[])\n        page.wait_for_function('__app.player.y<9',timeout=5000)\\\"\\\"\\\"\nif old not in s:raise Exception('test source mismatch')\ns=s.replace(old,new)\np.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 -m py_compile tools/browser-test.py\n/home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/bin/python tools/browser-test.py file touch\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_77","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('src/ui/interface.js');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace(\\\"if(s.phase==='combat'){if(this.selected==='guard')\\\", \\\"if(s.phase==='combat'){if(this.app.lastInput==='touch'&&this.game.settings.touchAssist&&this.selected\"'!=='\"'guard')this.assistChannel();if(this.selected==='guard')\\\")\nneedle=\\\"  cycleTarget(){const s=this.state;\\\"\nmethod=\\\"\\\"\\\"  assistChannel(){const e=this.target(),p=this.player;if(\"'!e||!p)return;const d=this.itemDef(p.hands[1]),distance=Math.abs(p.x-e.x)+Math.abs(p.y-e.y);const candidates=[{source:'\"'war',channel:'war',power:3,range:1},...(p.basicSpirit?[{source:'spirit',channel:'spirit',power:3,range:3}]:[]),...(d?.family==='weapon'&&(\"'!d.ammo||p.arrows>0)?[{...d,source:'\"'right'}]:[])];let best=null;for(const c of candidates){if(distance>c.range)continue;const reduction=c.channel==='war'?e.armor:e.ring,loss=Math.max(0,c.power-reduction),remaining=c.channel==='war'?e.war:e.spirit,score=loss/Math.max(1,remaining);if(\"'!best||score>best.score)best={source:c.source,score};}if(best)this.selected=best.source;else this.selected='\"'guard';}\\\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\ns=s.replace(needle,method+needle)\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('tools/browser-test.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"original_save=page.evaluate('localStorage.getItem(\\\\\\\"danger-expedition-v1\\\\\\\")')\\\\n    page.evaluate('__app.returnTitle();__DANGER.setIdle(9900);__app.update(0)')\\\", \\\"page.evaluate('__app.returnTitle()')\\\\n    original_save=page.evaluate('localStorage.getItem(\\\\\\\"danger-expedition-v1\\\\\\\")')\\\\n    page.evaluate('__DANGER.setIdle(9900);__app.update(0)')\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat >> src/ui/style.css <<'EOF'\n.touch-mode #combat-actions{display:flex;left:auto;right:4%;bottom:17%;justify-content:flex-end}.touch-mode #combat-actions button{display:none}.touch-mode #combat-actions [data-source=guard],.touch-mode #combat-actions [data-source=revive]:not([hidden]){display:block;padding:12px 18px;font-size:.75em}\nEOF\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Release verification in progress\n- All campaign/rule work complete. Rules now51/51 including normal solo+co-op routes and actual victory continuation. Protocol14/14.\n- Exact self-contained HTML built (~4.74MiB) root delivery. Canonical src/report.json plus exit-interview.json generated. Feedback still needs actual final counts filled.\n- Root main/UI/shell fully implemented: native menus/rebinding, focus, controller, keyboard, assisted multitouch, map/pack, viable solo saves/export/import, developer sliders/workshop, isolated10second attract.\n- Root source/UI review caught/fixed13 actual issues so far (see docs/ISSUES.md); presentation count grew2 additional art issues (7 total presentation; current issue ledger initially had5presentation, add scorpion/wraith before final count). Zero critical identified so far; do not invent defect counts from assertions.\n- First root file/touch suite caught quick keyboard presses missing movement; fixed fresh input check. Native title/pause fixes confirmed with diagnostic.\n- Test harness mistakes corrected separately: module-tag search falsely matched documentation inside inline JS; fixed stripping script bodies. Playwright evaluate returning Interface caused cyclic serialization (use block/no return). Synthetic touch with setPointerCapture was invalid; use real CDP multi-touch (main capture also guarded). These are test issues, not game defects.\n- Current root browser run session4655 tests file+touch after those test fixes; progress output at end. Agent multiplayer working tools/network-release.py full stock co-op real RTC plus extra Hub cases; coordinate max2browser processes.\n- Latest CSS TV font/assistChannel patch is not yet rebuilt; next build must include it. Before final rerun npmrunverify command on exact artifact, report JSON parse/metadata matches, inspect screenshots of pack/map/dev/phone/victory. Remaining main tests: root file/touch finish, rtc UI group, official final5Hub+full soloHub route, WebGPU/WebKit/Firefox fallbacks; network release full co-op. Final docs/report exact counts/research evidence then rebuild and final verification.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
