issue ledger separates them from test-harness mistakes.';r['engineFeedback'][1]='Custom input maps need explicit menu directions. Native Shell pause/fade bookkeeping needed integration with a live online world, and the three.js import expected GPUShaderStage constants on Firefox before capability checks could run.';p.write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\nPY\nbiome check --write src/main.js src/ui/interface.js --diagnostic-level=error --max-diagnostics=5\nnpm run build\"","aggregated_output":"Skipped 46 suggested fixes.\nIf you wish to apply the suggested (unsafe) fixes, use the command biome check --write --unsafe\n\nChecked 2 files in 67ms. Fixed 2 files.\nBuilt Advanced-Dungeons-and-Danger-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-Treasure-of-Tarmin-1983-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-040257.html (4.76 MiB; all runtime dependencies embedded)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
